		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Crossroads is the heart of the {link:horde}Horde{/link} in the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}, a walled town of orcish huts on a hill where the great roads meet. One runs north to the {link:the-mor-shan-rampart}Mor'shan Rampart{/link} and {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link}, one east to {link:durotar}Durotar{/link} and {link:ratchet}Ratchet{/link}, one south to {link:camp-taurajo}Camp Taurajo{/link}, and one west toward {link:stonetalon-mountains}Stonetalon{/link} and {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}. {link:thork}Thork{/link} keeps its walls, {link:sergra-darkthorn}Sergra Darkthorn{/link} trains its hunters, and the guards on its tower watch the grass for {link:centaurs}centaur{/link}. An {link:orcs}orc{/link}, a {link:tauren}tauren{/link} druid and a {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link} apothecary may share the same fire here, and the wind riders of Devrak carry word to {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link}. Of late, traders of a company called Durotar Supply and Logistics have raised a trading post just west of the walls.]=],
		},
	},
})

