			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Camp Taurajo is the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} stronghold of the southern {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}, a ring of tents and totems on the road to {link:thousand-needles}Thousand Needles{/link}. It guards the plains that lead to {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}, and its braves ride out against the {link:quilboar}quilboar{/link} camps on every side. The hunter {link:jorn-skyseer}Jorn Skyseer{/link} teaches here, the smith {link:tatternack-steelforge}Tatternack Steelforge{/link} studies the weapons of the enemy, and in a cage at the camp's edge sits {link:mangletooth}Mangletooth{/link}, a quilboar whom his own tribe left to rot. Grunt Logmar has lately heard that human soldiers from {link:dustwallow-marsh}Dustwallow Marsh{/link} are toppling the landmarks of the tauren pathfinders on the eastern border.]=],
