		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Ratchet is a goblin port on the eastern shore of the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}, at the edge of the {link:the-merchant-coast}Merchant Coast{/link}. The goblin {link:gazlowe}Gazlowe{/link} built it with the gold he earned raising {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link}, and it belongs to the {link:steamwheedle-cartel}Steamwheedle Cartel{/link}. Here {link:orcs}orc{/link} and human can buy and sell side by side, for the bruisers of the town keep the peace with a heavy hand. Ships sail from its docks to {link:booty-bay}Booty Bay{/link} across the sea. Its tinkers build shredders, its brewers keep old recipes, and its merchants chase every rumor of profit from the {link:the-sludge-fen}Sludge Fen{/link} to the {link:wailing-caverns}Wailing Caverns{/link}. Pirates and sharks are its only true enemies, and it has plenty of both.]=],
