		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Lushwater Oasis lies south of the {link:the-crossroads}Crossroads{/link}, a spread of palms and pools in the dry grass. It is one of the new oases that have bubbled up from beneath the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link} in recent years. On its northern side rises a rocky hill, and inside the hill opens the mouth of the {link:wailing-caverns}Wailing Caverns{/link}, from which the wind moans day and night. The {link:kolkar-centaurs}Kolkar centaur{/link} of {link:hezrul-bloodmark}Hezrul Bloodmark{/link} camp around the water. Two disciples of the druid {link:naralex}Naralex{/link} keep watch on the hill above the caverns, and the beasts that drink here have begun to grow strange.]=],
		},
	},
