			text = [=[The Field of Giants covers the southern plains of the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}, between {link:camp-taurajo}Camp Taurajo{/link} and the border of {link:dustwallow-marsh}Dustwallow Marsh{/link}. Great towers of dried earth rise from the grass, and from afar they look like giants standing still. Thunder lizards and kodo graze among them. Of late, insect-like creatures called silithid have appeared in the field. They dig hives, lay eggs and seem to think in a way no beast should. Korran of the {link:the-crossroads}Crossroads{/link} studies them for his masters in {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link}, and the hunter {link:jorn-skyseer}Jorn Skyseer{/link} fears they herald a grim future.]=],
