		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Dreadmist Peak rises northwest of the {link:the-crossroads}Crossroads{/link}, its summit wrapped in a red mist. The cultists of the {link:burning-blade}Burning Blade{/link} hold its heights. In a cave near the top, above an altar of fire, they keep the Demon Seed, a tool of the {link:burning-legion}Burning Legion{/link}. The pools at the summit feed the weather of the northern plains, and the druids fear that the cult has poisoned them, and that the sickness spreading among the gazelles of the plains begins there. Even {link:neeru-fireblade}Neeru Fireblade{/link} of {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link} has asked for the Seed to be destroyed. It is said that in the years after the {link:third-war}Third War{/link}, {link:jaina-proudmoore}Jaina Proudmoore{/link} herself fought a demon upon this peak.]=],
