			text = [=[Blackthorn Ridge is a thorny valley in the south of the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}, north of the great warren of {link:razorfen-kraul}Razorfen Kraul{/link}. The {link:razormane-quilboar}Razormane quilboar{/link} hold it. Three chieftains have climbed out of the Kraul to command their war on the {link:horde}Horde{/link}: {link:nak}Nak{/link} the seer, Kuz the tracker, and {link:lok-orcbane}Lok Orcbane{/link}, their warlord. Their camps lie among the thorns. On the ridge above the valley, the {link:orcs}orc{/link} shaman Brine keeps a lonely camp beside a pool of pure water, and teaches the young shaman of the Horde the call of water.]=],
