			text = [=[Boulder Lode Mine lies in the far northeast of the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}, beyond the {link:the-sludge-fen}Sludge Fen{/link}. Orcish timbers still frame its tunnels, but the {link:venture-company}Venture Company{/link} has claimed it. Word travels fast to {link:ratchet}Ratchet{/link}, and the latest word says that one of the goblin miners has dug up an emerald as big as a fist. The wharfmaster of Ratchet knows buyers who would pay well for it, and he is not the only one who has heard.]=],
		},
	},
})

