		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Sludge Fen lies in the northeast of the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}. The {link:venture-company}Venture Company{/link} has raised an oil derrick over it, and what was a pool of water is now a mire of black sludge. Supervisor Lugwizzle runs the works from the top of the derrick, and goblin shredders stalk the shore. The tinkers of {link:ratchet}Ratchet{/link} envy the company's new machines. One of them, Wizzlecrank, crept in to steal a shredder and found too late that he had no key to make it walk.]=],
		},
	},
})

