		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Grol'dom Farm is a pig farm of the orcs on the road between the {link:the-crossroads}Crossroads{/link} and {link:durotar}Durotar{/link}, one of the many that have sprung up since {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link} was founded. It is a quiet place of pens and swine. Its master, Kranal Fiss, is a shaman of the {link:horde}Horde{/link}. He sends those who would tame fire to a hidden shrine in Durotar, and asks them to bring the torch back to him aflame.]=],
