• He sent his man {link:rezlak}Rezlak{/link} to go on helping the orcs in Durotar.
• He sponsors the goblin racers of {link:thousand-needles}Thousand Needles{/link} and hunts down parts for their machines.
• He has built an observatory in Ratchet, and waits on its lenses.]=],
